MSItFJ6NWRPyPJaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSe7VimXuTpLhM_XKQMbPPsi-KTvsrd_TtUiMgymeu0FA&oe=6B0313AC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ape Complex", "keywords": ["Ape", "Lethal", "Gorilla", "Animal", "Scary"], "long_description": "Welcome to Ape Complex,\n\n where you, a somehow talking ape ( dont ask, just accept it ), find yourself trapped in the world\u2019s most depressing concrete hallway simulator. Yes, the interior design is 99% grey walls and flickering fluorescent lights, perfect for setting the mood of \u201cI want to escape, but also maybe cry.\u201d\n\nBut wait\u2014this isn\u2019t just a walking tour of OSHA violations. Lurking in the corridors is Sandman, a lanky, nightmare-fuel monster who struts around on two legs like he owns the place. \nYour job? \nSurvive.. or sum idrk lol.\nSo grab your courage (and maybe a banana or two) and prepare to sprint, scream, and slip into madness. After all, nothing says \u201cfun evening\u201d quite like being an ape hunted by a man-shaped nightmare in a warehouse basement.\n\nGAME BY: BRAINBYTEMEDIA", "short_description": "Welcome to Ape Complex, where you, a somehow talking ape ( dont ask, just accept it ), find yourself trapped in the world\u2019s most depressing concrete hallway simulator. Yes, the interior design is 99% grey walls and flickering fluorescent lights, perfect for setting the mood of \u201cI want to escape, but also maybe cry.\u201d\n\nGAME BY: BRAINBYTEMEDIA"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/brainbytemedia/brainbytemedia/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BrainByteMedia", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/brainbytemedia/brainbytemedia", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": 